{"id":"y0i826h641g0zhg3i0r8cb4ix","title":"动压气体轴承特性研究揭示","originalTitle":"研究揭示不同气体组分下陀螺仪电机中动压气体轴承的特性","summary":"北京航天自动控制研究所Jian Li团队研究了不同气体组分下陀螺仪电机中动压气体轴承的特性，基于相似理论建立模型并实验验证，结果表明关键气膜特性与理论预测高度吻合，最大相对偏差仅为1.8%。该研究为提高机电陀螺仪器的精度和可靠性提供了理论支持。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3650976&do=blog&id=1561731"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T05:51:33.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T13:47:35.214Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T13:47:35.214Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":25,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"0de66a13-d910-4d44-961d-24910bbf3ad3","title":"北京航天自动控制研究所研究动压气体轴承特性"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"0de66a13-d910-4d44-961d-24910bbf3ad3","title":"北京航天自动控制研究所研究动压气体轴承特性"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fKHwQzD6hcaE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}